me":"Alt-country","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1988,"end":2000,"desc":"La revolución iniciada en Chicago por Souled American y Uncle Tupelo (No Depression: baladas country con la furia del hardcore) se convierte en los noventa en un género propio: sus herederos abandonan el hardcore por los sonidos más espartanos y tradicionales. Son Volt de Jay Farrar y Wilco de Jeff Tweedy (Being There, Yankee Hotel Foxtrot); Will Oldham (Palace) arranca el movimiento; Freakwater, Ida, Handsome Family, Retsin, Blue Mountain, Whiskeytown, Grant Lee Buffalo, Citizens' Utilities, Willard Grant Conspiracy. El «chamber folk» de Lambchop, Lullaby For The Working Class, Geraldine Fibbers y Pinetop Seven; el country-rock de Volebeats, Ass Ponys, Sixteen Horsepower, Old 97's y los terroristas Grifters; el folk-rock de Swell, Counting Crows, Cracker, Cake, Hootie & The Blowfish; los Black Crowes; Belle And Sebastian, Arab Strap y los polacos Atman.","color":"#f59e0b","family":"Raíces: rock'n'roll, country y roots","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#alt-country"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":17238604211028,"artist":"Lambchop","artist_id":69959009722472,"title":"I Hope You're Sitting Down","year":1994,"ess":0,"yt":"lSOEUXRzLxw","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Alt-country","scene_id":267868162516031,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#alt-country","chapters":["Sección 6.14"],"pages":[[1,278,null]]},{"id":272963170563041,"artist":"Lambchop","artist_id":69959009722472,"title":"How I Quit Smoking","year":1996,"ess":0,"yt":"g-WjNWqqvuE","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Alt-country","scene_id":267868162516031,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#alt-country","chapters":["Sección 6.1